adaptive-enhance is a standalone Rust port of adaptiveImageEnhancement from
OpenCE by Zhenqiang Ying:

  https://github.com/baidut/OpenCE
  https://baidut.github.io/OpenCE/caip2017.html

OpenCE is distributed under the MIT License. This port reimplements the
algorithm and the relevant OpenCV behavior without depending on OpenCV.
